==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Madam Peng]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Grand Emperor Warumongar]] spawns as the boss.
**20 [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**2 [[Madam Peng]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Grand Emperor Warumongar might seem scary at first, but you can duo him with merely a Lv.10 [[Scarf Cat (Special Cat)|Red Nyanko Ranger]] and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]].

